&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;In this role, you will&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Create and deliver production-ready, scalable and high-quality machine learning models and associated algorithms that can make actions in game environments&lt;/li&gt;
